  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida beh&#xf6;ver mer information om den interna kontrollen av organisationen Just Associates (JASS) som har skickat en ans&#xf6;kan om finansiering fr&#xe5;n strategin om st&#xf6;d till civilsamh&#xe4;llet. D&#xe4;rf&#xf6;r anlitar Sida en konsult genom denna insats f&#xf6;r att utf&#xf6;ra en bed&#xf6;mning baserad p&#xe5; en utformad uppdragsbeskrivning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida needs more information about the internal control of the organization Just Associates (JASS) who have sent an application for fiancial support from the strategy of support to the civil society. Sida is therefore engaging a consultant through this contribution to carry out an assessment based on a defined terms of reference.</narrative>
